<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to December 16 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to December 16 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to December 16 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>					    1996/97	     1995/96</p>
<p>					16/12    01/12     16/12    01/12</p>
<p>SUGAR CANE(million tonnes)    230.14   224.34    202.73   198.67</p>
<p>SUGAR(million tonnes)	    10.39    10.17	9.20     8.98</p>
<p>ALCOHOL(million cubic meters)  12.01    11.72     10.76    10.52</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
